librist
------------------------------------------
Library that can be used to add the RIST protocol to applications

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libcjson-devel-1.7.19-1bl2
  libcjson1-1.7.19-1bl2
  liblz4-devel-1.9.4-1
  liblz4_1-1.9.4-1
  libmbedcrypto5-2.23.0-1
  libmicrohttpd12-1.0.10-1bl1
  librist-devel-0.2.20-1bl1
  librist4-0.2.20-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcjson-devel-1.7.19-1bl2
  liblz4-devel-1.9.4-1
  libmicrohttpd-devel-1.0.10-1bl1
  mbedtls-devel-2.23.0-1
  meson-1.10.2-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://code.videolan.org/rist/librist/

Canonical download:
  https://code.videolan.org/rist/librist/-/archive/v0.2.20/librist-v0.2.20.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack librist-0.2.20-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./librist-0.2.20-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/librist-0.2.20-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librist-0.2.20-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librist4-0.2.20-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/librist-devel-0.2.20-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(librist)
  /usr/bin/rist2rist.exe
  /usr/bin/ristreceiver.exe
  /usr/bin/ristsender.exe
  /usr/bin/ristsrppasswd.exe
  /usr/bin/udp2udp.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/librist.README
  /usr/share/doc/librist/CONTRIBUTING.md
  /usr/share/doc/librist/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/librist/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/librist/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/librist/THANKS.md
  /usr/share/doc/librist/VSF_TR-06-1.pdf
  /usr/share/doc/librist/VSF_TR-06-2.pdf
  /usr/share/doc/librist/docs/RIST_vs_SRT.png
  /usr/share/doc/librist/docs/librist_logo.png

(librist4)
  /usr/bin/cygrist-4.dll

(librist-devel)
  /usr/include/librist/common.h
  /usr/include/librist/headers.h
  /usr/include/librist/librist.h
  /usr/include/librist/librist_config.h
  /usr/include/librist/librist_srp.h
  /usr/include/librist/logging.h
  /usr/include/librist/oob.h
  /usr/include/librist/opt.h
  /usr/include/librist/peer.h
  /usr/include/librist/receiver.h
  /usr/include/librist/sender.h
  /usr/include/librist/stats.h
  /usr/include/librist/transport.h
  /usr/include/librist/tun.h
  /usr/include/librist/tunnel.h
  /usr/include/librist/udpsocket.h
  /usr/include/librist/urlparam.h
  /usr/include/librist/version.h
  /usr/lib/librist.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/librist.pc

